{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
During this turn, all your "Ice Princess" family Spirits are unaffected by opposing effects. Then, reveal three cards from your decktop. You can pay one cost to summon an "Ice Princess" family Spirit card among them. Discard any remaining cards. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

